{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"MoeruAI.AIRI","latestVersion":"0.15.1","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.969f3b3e.png","priority":1,"sha256":"969f3b3eb9322d495c8ed2af24658828f639b96397f92ae6ce2e443abb8d3d71","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"copyright":"© Moeru AI 2026","description":"Re-creating Neuro-sama, a container of souls of AI waifu / virtual characters to bring them into our worlds.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"copyright":"© Moeru AI 2026","description":"Re-creating Neuro-sama, a container of souls of AI waifu / virtual characters to bring them into our worlds.","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","name":"AIRI","packageUrl":"https://airi.moeru.ai/docs/","publisher":"moeru","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/issues","publisherUrl":"https://moeru.ai/","releaseNotes":"v0.15.1 Highlights\nA small patch release for the iOS app, with a little polish for the desktop about window.\nProduct updates\nMobile\n- The iOS app is now built with the iOS 27.1 SDK. v0.15.0 still used the iOS 26 SDK, so on iPhone Duo the app showed at a fixed size, with empty space around it. Full-screen display on iPhone Duo needs the new SDK. This build uses it.\nDesktop app\n- The about window of dev and nightly builds now keeps the build origin, such as main@f4ef800c48, on one line. The build time now uses the app language and shows as a relative time, for example \"3 hours ago\". Hover over it to see the full date and time.\nTo contributors\n- iOS release builds now run on the GitHub xcode-27 runner image with Xcode 27.1. The image is a public preview, so a failed iOS build can need a rerun.\n- The core-agent Spark command tests now import from source, so they also pass in a fresh checkout that has no build output.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/releases/tag/v0.15.1","tags":["ai","live2d","vtuber"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"模型驱动的灵魂容器，什么都能做一点的桌宠：让 Neuro-sama 这样的虚拟伴侣也成为我们世界中的一份子吧！","locale":"zh-CN","packageUrl":"https://airi.moeru.ai/docs/zh-Hans/","tags":["live2d","人工智能","皮套人","虚拟主播"]}},"name":"AIRI","packageUrl":"https://airi.moeru.ai/docs/","publisher":"moeru","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/issues","publisherUrl":"https://moeru.ai/","releaseNotes":"v0.15.1 Highlights\nA small patch release for the iOS app, with a little polish for the desktop about window.\nProduct updates\nMobile\n- The iOS app is now built with the iOS 27.1 SDK. v0.15.0 still used the iOS 26 SDK, so on iPhone Duo the app showed at a fixed size, with empty space around it. Full-screen display on iPhone Duo needs the new SDK. This build uses it.\nDesktop app\n- The about window of dev and nightly builds now keeps the build origin, such as main@f4ef800c48, on one line. The build time now uses the app language and shows as a relative time, for example \"3 hours ago\". Hover over it to see the full date and time.\nTo contributors\n- iOS release builds now run on the GitHub xcode-27 runner image with Xcode 27.1. The image is a public preview, so a failed iOS build can need a rerun.\n- The core-agent Spark command tests now import from source, so they also pass in a fresh checkout that has no build output.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/moeru-ai/airi/releases/tag/v0.15.1","tags":["ai","live2d","vtuber"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.15.1/app.json","detailSha256":"333493ca8f461939f69d325fbab44d98dc4478a62ba4110253a960580999e6b1","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"0.15.1"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/0.14.1/app.json","detailSha256":"a5a469b675baaffeb222ac313fd926929bb9581b4006a4484c3a65e16b67470d","releaseDate":"2026-10-30","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"0.14.1"},{"architectures